\b What this software does\b0\par
\par
Safe Browse filters web access on this PC by running a local DNS service. It records the top-level website names visited and the requests it blocks, so a parent can review them in the Safe Browse console.\par
\par
It does not record page addresses, search terms, message contents, or anything typed into a page. It does not install a certificate to inspect encrypted traffic.\par
\par
After installation you will be asked for a setup code from the parent console to link this PC to a child profile.\par
